{"task_id": "Mbpp/412", "solution": "def remove_odd(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Validate input and return new list of even integers. Raises TypeError on invalid input.\"\"\"\n\n    def _validate_input(lst):\n        \"\"\"Raise TypeError if lst is not a list or contains non-int elements.\"\"\"\n        if not isinstance(lst, list):\n            raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n        if not all(isinstance(x, int) for x in lst):\n            raise TypeError(\"List elements must be integers.\")\n\n    def _filter_even(lst):\n        \"\"\"Return a new list containing only even integers from lst in original order.\"\"\"\n        return [x for x in lst if x % 2 == 0]\n\n    _validate_input(input_list)\n    return _filter_even(input_list)"}
