{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"Compute arithmetic mean of cubes 1..n and return float.\n    It calculates the sum of cubes from 1 to n and divides by n.\"\"\"\n    \n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += k ** 3\n        \n    average = sum_of_cubes / float(n)\n    \n    return average"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/421", "solution": "def validateInput(input_tuple):\n    \"\"\"\n    Validates that the input is a tuple.\n    Raises TypeError if input_tuple is not a tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_tuple, tuple):\n        raise TypeError('input_tuple must be a tuple')\n\ndef convertElementsToString(input_tuple):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts each element in the input tuple to its string representation.\n    Returns a new list of strings.\n    \"\"\"\n    return [str(item) for item in input_tuple]\n\ndef concatenate_tuple(input_tuple, delimiter='-') -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Concatenates each element of a tuple by a specified delimiter.\n    Each element is first converted to its string representation.\n    \"\"\"\n    validateInput(input_tuple)\n    string_elements = convertElementsToString(input_tuple)\n    return delimiter.join(string_elements)"}
